# Project Context — Velora

**Product:** Velora — نظام كاشير وإدارة فروع (multi-location POS + light ERP). 
**Repo:** GitHub `velora` · local folder `velora` · npm package `velora` · Vercel project `velora` · production `https://velora-oms.vercel.app` · UI kit folder: `Velora`. 
**System map:** Read and keep `SYSTEM_MAP.md` current when modules, primary path, roles, or integrations change.

## Stack

- Next.js 16 App Router · React 19 · Tailwind 4
- Supabase (Auth, Postgres, RLS, Storage)
- shadcn (base-nova) + **Velora** composites (`src/components/Velora/*`)
- TanStack Table · Zustand · RHF+Zod · sonner
- Edge session: `src/proxy.ts` (not legacy middleware assumptions)

## Architecture

```
src/app/(shell|operational|auth|print)/  → thin routes
src/modules/<domain>/{actions,services,components}
src/lib/repositories/ · src/lib/auth/ · src/stores/
```

## UI language

Arabic-first RTL (`lang="ar"` `dir="rtl"`, Cairo). Shared chrome via `t()`; many ops labels hardcoded Arabic. Public QR menu at `/menu`.

## Design reference

Follow `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` and existing Velora primitives (`PageHeader`, `OperationalCard`, `DataTableShell`, `StandardModal`, state blocks). Do not add a second design system.

